 data-kid=\"166\">Real-time Bus</div>\n              <div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-zinc-500\" data-kid=\"167\">PUBSUB / SOCKET.IO</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"168\">\n            <div class=\"w-48 h-48 flex items-center justify-center\" data-kid=\"169\">\n               <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\" data-kid=\"170\">\n                 <div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 rounded flex items-center justify-center\" data-kid=\"171\">\n                   <i class=\"ti ti-database text-amber-500 text-xl\" data-kid=\"172\"></i>\n                 </div>\n                 <div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 rounded flex items-center justify-center\" data-kid=\"173\">\n                   <i class=\"ti ti-cloud text-blue-500 text-xl\" data-kid=\"174\"></i>\n                 </div>\n                 <div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 rounded flex items-center justify-center\" data-kid=\"175\">\n                   <i class=\"ti ti-search text-emerald-500 text-xl\" data-kid=\"176\"></i>\n                 </div>\n                 <div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 rounded flex items-center justify-center\" data-kid=\"177\">\n                   <i class=\"ti ti-lock text-rose-500 text-xl\" data-kid=\"178\"></i>\n                 </div>\n               </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"text-center\" data-kid=\"179\">\n              <div class=\"font-bold text-lg\" data-kid=\"180\">Knowledge Layer</div>\n              <div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-zinc-500\" data-kid=\"181\">POSTGRES / QDRANT / R2</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"features\" class=\"py-24 bg-zinc-950/50\" data-kid=\"182\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6\" data-kid=\"183\">\n      <div class=\"text-center mb-20\" data-kid=\"184\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tighter sm:text-4xl uppercase font-mono\" data-kid=\"185\">system.capabilities();</h2>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-1\" data-kid=\"186\">\n        \n        <div class=\"group border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 p-8 hover:bg-zinc-800/50 transition-all cursor-default\" data-kid=\"187\">\n          <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-12\" data-kid=\"188\">\n            <div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-cyan-500/10 rounded flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-500 border border-cyan-500/20\" data-kid=\"189\">\n              <i class=\"ti ti-zap text-2xl\" data-kid=\"190\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"font-mono text-zinc-700 text-xs\" data-kid=\"191\">SPEC_01</span>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\" data-kid=\"192\">Parallel Agent Swarm</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-mono\" data-kid=\"193\">\n            Nine specialized agents work simultaneously, not sequentially. Build frontends, backends, and databases at once — like a real team.\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-zinc-800/50 font-mono text-[10px] text-zinc-600 space-y-2\" data-kid=\"194\">\n            <div data-kid=\"195\">> STATUS: ACTIVE</div>\n            <div data-kid=\"196\">> LATENCY: < 120ms</div>\n            <div data-kid=\"197\">> NODES: 9/9 ONLINE</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"group border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 p-8 hover:bg-zinc-800/50 transition-all cursor-default\" data-kid=\"198\">\n          <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-12\" data-kid=\"199\">\n            <div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-purple-500/10 rounded flex items-center justify-center text-purple-500 border border-purple-500/20\" data-kid=\"200\">\n              <i class=\"ti ti-shield-check text-2xl\" data-kid=\"201\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"font-mono text-zinc-700 text-xs\" data-kid=\"202\">SPEC_02</span>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\" data-kid=\"203\">Atomic Security Audit</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-mono\" data-kid=\"204\">\n            Every project undergoes a dedicated Security Agent audit. OWASP Top 10 checks, dependency scanning, and secret detection.\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-zinc-800/50 font-mono text-[10px] text-zinc-600 space-y-2\" data-kid=\"205\">\n            <div data-kid=\"206\">> SCAN: PENDING</div>\n            <div data-kid=\"207\">> THREAT_LEVEL: NULL</div>\n            <div data-kid=\"208\">> AUDIT: CONTINUOUS</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"group border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 p-8 hover:bg-zinc-800/50 transition-all cursor-default\" data-kid=\"209\">\n          <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-12\" data-kid=\"210\">\n            <div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-500 border border-emerald-500/20\" data-kid=\"211\">\n              <i class=\"ti ti-code-plus text-2xl\" data-kid=\"212\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"font-mono text-zinc-700 text-xs\" data-kid=\"213\">SPEC_03</span>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\" data-kid=\"214\">Iterative Refinement</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-mono\" data-kid=\"215\">\n            Chat with the Supervisor to request changes. Agents adapt existing code instead of regenerating from scratch.\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-zinc-800/50 font-mono text-[10px] text-zinc-600 space-y-2\" data-kid=\"216\">\n            <div data-kid=\"217\">> REVISION: v1.0.4</div>\n            <div data-kid=\"218\">> SYNC_STATE: READY</div>\n            <div